From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] propsys: property schema, descriptions, store composition, ChangeType targets (3569)

propsys: property schema (descriptions, lists, formatting), PropVariantChangeType targets, store composition

PSGetPropertyDescription/ByName/ListFromString/PSEnumeratePropertyDescriptions return IPropertyDescription2
objects built from the documented System.* keys (type, flags, label, display type, column state, sort and
condition data) and from registered .propdesc schema files (PSRegisterPropertySchema, refreshed by
PSRefreshPropertySchema). PSFormatForDisplay[Alloc]/PSFormatPropertyValue/PSCoerceToCanonicalValue/
PSGetPropertyValue/PSSetPropertyValue, IPropertyDescription::FormatForDisplay/CoerceToCanonicalValue.
PropVariantChangeType gains VT_BOOL, VT_R4, VT_R8, VT_CLSID, VT_FILETIME, VT_DATE, a real VT_BSTR, FILETIME to
string/number, PVCHF_ALPHABOOL. New: PSCreateMultiplexPropertyStore, PSCreateDelayedMultiplexPropertyStore,
PSCreateAdapterFromPropertyStore, PSCreatePropertyStoreFromPropertySetStorage, PSCreatePropertyStoreFromObject
wrapper/IPropertySetStorage, PSCreateSimplePropertyChange, PSCreatePropertyChangeArray,
PSGet[Named]PropertyFromPropertyStorage, PSLookupPropertyHandlerCLSID, PSGetItemPropertyHandler[WithCreateObject].
---
